{"slug":"big-sean-playboi-carti-headlining-north-american-unfriendly-reminder-tour","postId":72783,"title":"Big Sean & Playboi Carti Headlining North American \"Unfriendly Reminder Tour\"","htmlContent":"&nbsp;\n\n[caption id=\"attachment_146272\" align=\"aligncenter\" width=\"799\"]<img class=\"wp-image-146272 size-full\" src=\"http://35.224.26.164/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/1-90.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"799\" height=\"418\" /> Big Sean To Headline North American \"Unfriendly Reminder Tour\" (PRNewsfoto/Live Nation Entertainment)[/caption]\n\nGrammy-nominated and multi-platinum G.O.O.D. Music / Def Jam Recordings artist, Big Sean, announced today his North American headlining \"Unfriendly Reminder Tour\", which is set to kick off April 12th in Orlando, FL. The multi-city trek produced by Live Nation will hit a figure of major U.S. cities including Miami, Houston, Los Angeles, Atlanta, New York and Detroit. The outing will feature direct support from acclaimed rapper Playboi Carti, along with opening sets from Shy Glizzy and GASHI. Big Sean will perform fan favorites spanning his entire discography, going beyond a normal album tour. The 31-city tour is scheduled to wrap June 3rd in Toronto, Canada. See full routing of concert dates and venues below.'\n\nThe \"Unfriendly Reminder Tour\" will be a celebration of Big Sean's decade-long career signed to G.O.O.D. Music and pay tribute to his fans. Each fan will be able to vote and choose their top 20 songs from their respective cities and help curate the setlist from his full discography. Voting will be available beginning on Thursday, February 8th only at <a href=\"http://uknowbigsean.com\">uknowbigsean.com</a>. All stops will have brand new tour merchandise available and in select cities, fans will have the option to customize handpicked pieces.\n\nLive Nation pre-sale tickets will be available on <span class=\"xn-chron\">Thursday, February 8</span><sup>th</sup> at <span class=\"xn-chron\">10AM-10PM</span> local time. Tickets will go on sale to the general public on <span class=\"xn-chron\">Friday, February 9</span><sup>th</sup> at <span class=\"xn-chron\">10 AM</span> local time at <a class=\"linkOnClick\" href=\"https://www.livenation.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-include=\"300595170\">LiveNation.com</a>.\n\n&nbsp;\n<table id=\"convertedTable0e5c\" class=\"prntblns\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"prngen2\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p class=\"prnews_p\"><span class=\"prnews_span\"><b><u>\"Unfriendly Reminder\" Tour Dates:</u></b></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"prngen2\">\n<p class=\"prnews_p\"><span class=\"prnews_span\">Thursday, April 12<sup>th</sup></span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"prngen2\">\n<p class=\"prnews_p\"><span class=\"prnews_span\">Orlando, FL</span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"prngen2\">\n<p class=\"prnews_p\"><span class=\"prnews_span\">CFE Arena</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"prngen2\">\n<p class=\"prnews_p\"><span class=\"prnews_span\">Saturday, April 14<sup>th</sup></span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"prngen2\">\n<p class=\"prnews_p\"><span class=\"prnews_span\">Miami, FL</span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"prngen2\">\n<p class=\"prnews_p\"><span class=\"prnews_span\">Bayfront Park Amphitheatre</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"prngen2\">\n<p class=\"prnews_p\"><span class=\"prnews_span\">Sunday, April 15<sup>th</sup></span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"prngen2\">\n<p class=\"prnews_p\"><span class=\"prnews_span\">Jacksonville, FL</span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"prngen2\">\n<p class=\"prnews_p\"><span class=\"prnews_span\">Daily's Place</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"prngen2\">\n<p class=\"prnews_p\"><span class=\"prnews_span\">Wednesday, April 18<sup>th</sup></span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"prngen2\">\n<p class=\"prnews_p\"><span class=\"prnews_span\">Houston, TX</span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"prngen2\">\n<p class=\"prnews_p\"><span class=\"prnews_span\">Smart 